TEXT 48 1241 Left 2 ;Run: a stepped operating point. Plot V(dref)-V(irtn), DiffAmpRef - ISenseRTN, against k, the R28 wiper position: 0 = GND end, 1 = +12 end
TEXT 48 1265 Left 2 ;r21: 10k as fitted on the Rev 3.1 board; the sheet says 0 R (use 1m). ra, rb: the two halves of R28 (100 R) either side of the wiper
TEXT 48 1289 Left 2 ;ios: current into the U9 input, 200n = the LM7321 offset-current maximum. Model: LM7321_12V.lib beside this file, written by ../models/make_lm7321_12v.py
TEXT 48 1329 Left 2 !.include LM7321_12V.lib
TEXT 48 1353 Left 2 !.param r21=10k ra=100*(1-k)+1m rb=100*k+1m ios=0
TEXT 48 1377 Left 2 !.step param k 0 1 0.25
TEXT 48 1401 Left 2 !.op
